{
  "rule": "check_foreign_key_names_end_with_entity",
  "守着": [
    "GZ-W-128"
  ],
  "说明": {
    "护住什么": "GZ-W-128 外键条款（用户 2026-09-04 拍板）：外键固定为目标实体全名加 Id，前面可以加角色修饰（CreatedByStaffAccountId）；指向统一业务选项的外键按业务语义命名。\n守的规则：[GZ-W-128] 外键名是目标实体全名加 Id，可加角色修饰。人要知道、本门禁不判的部分见台账工程规则 GZ-W-128。",
    "口径": "领域层（Domain 目录、.Domain／.Core 项目或 src 下直接叫 Core 的项目）里 public long／long? 的 XxxId 属性：Id 前面那段词干，按大写字母切开的任何一个后缀是实体名就合规；一个都不是就报。实体全集取自 src 下 EF 配置类（*Configuration.cs，迁移目录除外）的 IEntityTypeConfiguration<T> 实参，以及这些文件里 using 别名指向的类型末段（Domain.Prescription.PrescriptionInfo 这种命名空间末段与实体同名的只能用别名）。遮罩注释与字面量。",
    "不算违规": "主键 Id；Legacy／Source 开头的来源原值列（GZ-W-128）；9 个业务选项语义外键词干（Bank、Category、SubCategory、Gender、MaritalStatus、Status、PendingReviewStatus、TransactionType、PaymentSource，今天 13 处），新增一个语义外键要同时改这里的正则。",
    "与旧实现的差别": "旧实现还有改名连带（F1）、指向已删实体（F3）两组——改名表的旧根名今天没有一个还是实体，结构上走不到；核对命名合同自身（F4）与判据自证（F5）是死代码，判据自证由本包正反例承担。都不重建（A0cf 续篇替用户定）。旧实现按基线分 warning／error，今天存量是 0，一律 error。"
  },
  "pipeline": [
    {
      "combinator": "sequence",
      "steps": [
        {
          "step": "selectFiles",
          "where": [
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "value": [
                ".cs"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "root",
              "value": [
                "src"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "excludeFolder",
              "value": [
                "{scan.ignoredDirectories}",
                "Migrations"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "includePath",
              "value": [
                "Configuration\\.cs$"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "至少几个": 1
        },
        {
          "step": "mask",
          "mode": "csharp"
        },
        {
          "step": "find",
          "patterns": [
            {
              "id": "配置的实体",
              "type": "expression",
              "value": "IEntityTypeConfiguration<\\s*([A-Za-z0-9_]+)\\s*>"
            },
            {
              "id": "别名指向的实体",
              "type": "expression",
              "value": "\\busing\\s+[A-Za-z0-9_]+\\s*=\\s*[A-Za-z0-9_.]*\\.([A-Za-z0-9_]+)\\s*;"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "function",
          "name": "跨文件事实集合",
          "arguments": [
            {
              "name": "来源",
              "kind": "SpanList",
              "source": "stream"
            },
            {
              "name": "键",
              "kind": "SpanList",
              "source": "literal",
              "value": [
                "捕获1"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "as": "实体"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "combinator": "sequence",
      "steps": [
        {
          "step": "selectFiles",
          "where": [
            {
              "type": "extension",
              "value": [
                ".cs"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "root",
              "value": [
                "src"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "excludeFolder",
              "value": [
                "{scan.ignoredDirectories}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "includePath",
              "value": [
                "^src/(?:(?:.*/)?(?:Domain|[^/]+\\.(?:Domain|Core))|Core)/"
              ]
            }
          ],
          "至少几个": 1
        },
        {
          "step": "mask",
          "mode": "csharp"
        },
        {
          "step": "find",
          "patterns": [
            {
              "id": "外键词干",
              "type": "expression",
              "value": "(?<=^[ \\t]*public\\s+(?:required\\s+)?(?:virtual\\s+)?long\\s*\\??\\s+)(?!Legacy|Source)(?!(?:Bank|Category|SubCategory|Gender|MaritalStatus|Status|PendingReviewStatus|TransactionType|PaymentSource)Id\\b)[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*?(?=Id\\s*(?:\\{|=>|;|$))",
              "multiline": true
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "combinator": "forEach",
          "each": "命中",
          "body": [
            {
              "combinator": "if",
              "condition": [
                {
                  "step": "find",
                  "patterns": [
                    {
                      "id": "词干后缀",
                      "type": "expression",
                      "value": "(?=([A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*)$)"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "step": "function",
                  "name": "跨文件事实集合",
                  "arguments": [
                    {
                      "name": "来源",
                      "kind": "SpanList",
                      "source": "stream"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "键",
                      "kind": "SpanList",
                      "source": "literal",
                      "value": [
                        "捕获1"
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "step": "assert",
                  "predicate": "notIn",
                  "values": [
                    {
                      "type": "from",
                      "value": "实体"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "then": [
                {
                  "step": "emit",
                  "rule": "foreign-key-missing-entity-root",
                  "severity": "error",
                  "message": "外键 {0}Id 的名字尾部不是任何实体名：外键必须是「目标实体全名＋Id」，前面可以加角色修饰（GZ-W-128）。",
                  "suggestion": "改成 {被指向实体全名}Id（或 {角色}{实体全名}Id）；指向统一业务选项的外键按业务语义命名，并把新词干加进这条门禁配置的语义外键清单。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
